 "remarks": "TO BE BUILT in North Stamford. Designed for comfortable everyday living and effortless entertaining, this five-bedroom home offers generous gathering spaces and the flexibility of a first-floor bedroom suite. An island kitchen with a pantry and dedicated coffee bar anchors the main level, complemented by spacious living and dining areas and a generous terrace for outdoor enjoyment. The first-floor bedroom includes a full bath and walk-in closet, providing a welcoming retreat for guests or an option for main-level living. Upstairs, the expansive primary suite features a large walk-in closet and a bath with a separate tub and shower. Three additional bedrooms and second-floor laundry add everyday convenience. With four full baths, two half baths, a mudroom, attached two-car garage, and inviting front porch, the design balances comfort and function. An unfinished walk-up third floor and basement provide abundant storage and space for future possibilities.",
